abstract: >-
  Analysis framework and processed results for deep WES of NA12878/HG001
  on three platforms. Version 1.1.0 replaces 66 formal GPU HaplotypeCaller
  runs with interval-matched BQSR results and includes 450 formal runs,
  454 archived run identifiers, 132 formal CPU and GPU pairs, revised
  concordance and quality statistics, source data and figures.
